{"id":207,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>走出校园，奔赴广阔天地！这个暑假，许思彤同学以志愿服务为笔、以赛事参与为墨，在社会实践的画卷中书写下温暖与成长。三大主题实践步履不停，每一步都踏得坚实、藏着感动，让我们一同走进她的青春答卷。<br></p><p><strong>童心守护：为 “双减”落地注入青春力量</strong></p><p>许思彤积极参与“七彩假期”“团团护航，乐托秦都”志愿活动，通过课后托管与趣味课堂陪伴孩子们成长。黏土课上，她见证孩子们将普通黏土变为灵动作品，想象力在指尖绽放；脸谱制作中，孩子们亲手勾勒京剧图案，文化自信悄然生根。这些活动正是“五育并举”的生动实践，也让她感受到国家为青少年全面发展所倾注的决心。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wollX8ozlDMmfVM/zLanmGbUllYMR7KYMm-4L8liLNn7MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyYLShkL1yPLzNZozT2U87YUmrRUmU4o7lsLlUPnR7YM7VFLNC8MNnRLNQFLzT7oR7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/321B2119899FCA2B5CB438E71D1D124A/2F46DC2F/19D81\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 279px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wollX8ozlDMmfVM/zLanmGbUllYMR7KYMm-4L8liLNn7MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyYLShkL1yPLzNZozT2U87YUmrRUmU4o7lsLlUPnR7YM7VFLNC8MNnRLNQFLzT7oR7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wLRLXPnzL8Ll-bM/mG4n7Q7UmVknzTK7L4rVMRlDMNr2Lml0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPM1yDUShVnz74Um7DUmvYnlCsU8U4nmGsUzVkMl-YLmfFMN7iMmNDL8MFLz-iU8lJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1166AEE13B16B72EF7CD3F07A1B5B220/6A56963C/125CE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 279px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wLRLXPnzL8Ll-bM/mG4n7Q7UmVknzTK7L4rVMRlDMNr2Lml0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPM1yDUShVnz74Um7DUmvYnlCsU8U4nmGsUzVkMl-YLmfFMN7iMmNDL8MFLz-iU8lJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\"><br></p><p><strong>赛事见证：在运动中触摸包容与活力</strong></p><p>从市级到省级跳绳赛事，许思彤亲历了体育的无限魅力与包容力量：30+上班族挤出时间奔赴赛场，6岁萌娃带着稚气兴奋候场，更有残障选手在志愿者的陪伴下自信起舞、绽放光芒。现场此起彼伏的掌声里，她深刻领悟到“全民健身”从不是一句口号，而是每个普通人都能触及的温暖体验，是跨越年龄、身份、身体条件的平等与尊重。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUNnXfLRUZMzNaL/zGbM8nRM4nRLlUKaM7CPMl-so7liUzC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkUSyPU1yZL7lDolMkU4-YnNU8UmV2nRU8nmrRo7lZLmnFnmG4LzGaolMFLz-PLmCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BBA1B80E69CBC22FD4B1FD44F5C8E824/F031009C/12126\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 320px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUNnXfLRUZMzNaL/zGbM8nRM4nRLlUKaM7CPMl-so7liUzC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hkUSyPU1yZL7lDolMkU4-YnNU8UmV2nRU8nmrRo7lZLmnFnmG4LzGaolMFLz-PLmCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wo7UXDLznVnR67L/mN8Lm9YUzUDoRAK7U494n7r2M7UDLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hknkhfnSyZM8-aMNQVL4lsU4Vknll4Mmv4L4MRMll4n7QFMRvsUNCPnmVFLzCDnzNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6BDAE87B06FE357C1BEE367333C5E3DF/477BF1F1/166E9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 289px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wo7UXDLznVnR67L/mN8Lm9YUzUDoRAK7U494n7r2M7UDLRU0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hknkhfnSyZM8-aMNQVL4lsU4Vknll4Mmv4L4MRMll4n7QFMRvsUNCPnmVFLzCDnzNJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\"><br></p><p><strong>实践感悟：在时代沃土中扎根成长</strong></p><p>响应“返家乡”号召，她以基层服务助力乡村振兴，让个人成长与社会需求同频共振；在赛事保障中，她见证社会对视障群体的尊重与支持，感受到国家构建包容环境、推动全民参与的坚定努力。这些经历让她愈发坚定：青年的成长从不止于校园，唯有扎根实践、融入时代，以微光之力汇聚暖流，方能在锤炼中绽放更绚丽的光彩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wMlCXZU8lPoRMRU/4TVUzAVUlC4UNMKVMlW2nRQ2ol-aMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yiLYhVLYyDM49PL4Q7M4rfU4Q2ozNDMNMknzlaozU8UzfFol7aLRUaozfFL4Q7Mz-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F53E3678136D75AC6F9966CBE50944A0/9A004090/36D52\" vheight=\" 476px\" vwidth=\" 456px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wMlCXZU8lPoRMRU/4TVUzAVUlC4UNMKVMlW2nRQ2ol-aMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yiLYhVLYyDM49PL4Q7M4rfU4Q2ozNDMNMknzlaozU8UzfFol7aLRUaozfFL4Q7Mz-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>许思彤的暑期实践，是一次身体力行的成长蜕变。她在服务中读懂责任，在参与中学会包容，更在行动中找准了个人与家国发展的契合点。愿这份温暖而坚定的实践力量，能激励更多青年走出舒适区，在广阔天地中经风雨、长才干，让青春在奉献与担当里焕发别样光彩！</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUlUXbnRliUzWkM/8VkU4CinlrVU4rK7U8-4MmMRMNMRLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8MShkLYyaUmL4Ml74nR7sM8C8nRUZMNQkLlW2L7L8o7WFL87PL8LYoRTFLmQkn7LJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A45B30B335A3D177F4D486FB1BF0C48B/3A13C289/26BDC\" vheight=\"388\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wUlUXbnRliUzWkM/8VkU4CinlrVU4rK7U8-4MmMRMNMRLlL0gihFp2hmCIa0USy8MShkLYyaUmL4Ml74nR7sM8C8nRUZMNQkLlW2L7L8o7WFL87PL8LYoRTFLmQkn7LJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wollX8ozlDMmfVM/zLanmGbUllYMR7KYMm-4L8liLNn7MlC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyYLShkL1yPLzNZozT2U87YUmrRUmU4o7lsLlUPnR7YM7VFLNC8MNnRLNQFLzT7oR7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLz9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17018&e=.png"}